 "solution": "`uni/infra/mcpInstP-default`: `{\"mcpInstPol\": {\"attributes\": {\"adminSt\": \"enabled\", \"key\": \"Mcp#Fabric2026\", \"ctrl\": \"pdu-per-vlan\", \"loopProtectAct\": \"port-disable\"}}}`, `uni/infra/epLoopProtectP-default` adminSt=enabled, EPG App prio=level2.",
